    - target: {fileID: 5114338960696120362, guid: 2b0b9228b76435b4ba491c473b305c94, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'How to Use RigProp Animation


        1. Add a RigProp(*FishingRod,
        Umbrella) prefab as a child of the ''Prop_R/L'' node.

        2. Rename
        the RigProp(*FishingRod, Umbrella) prefab to ''Prf_RigProp_UseAnim''.

        3.
        If the RigProp has Springbone applied, disable the ''Springbone Manager (script)''
        component of the RigProp prefab.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7880908629426928197, guid: 2b0b9228b76435b4ba491c473b305c94, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'How to Use RigProp Animation


        1. Add a RigProp(*FishingRod,
        Umbrella) prefab as a child of the ''Prop_R/L'' node.

        2. Rename
        the fishing rod prefab to ''Prf_RigProp_UseAnim''.

        3. Disable the
        ''Springbone Manager (Script)'' component of the fishing rod pre-pack.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
